WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.259
Sometimes you are done. Here is how you leave Popkin.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.627
At the foot of your account: Delete my account.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.938
First it says what goes: your name, photo, phone number and direct messages.

00:00:21.138 --> 00:00:25.288
What stays: your messages and photos in Popkins, without your name.

00:00:25.488 --> 00:00:29.321
And the Popkins you host. Those two wrap up when your account goes.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.086
Delete my account stays disabled until you type the word delete.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.110
Then it says Deleting. Your session ends, and the landing page opens with a message:

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:48.870
your account is deleted.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.662
On a phone it is a sheet from the bottom. On a desktop, a panel in the middle.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.772
What the tests prove: within thirty days, the Worker erases your name, number and

00:01:06.772 --> 00:01:09.900
photo. Your messages stay, from a Former member.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.769
That is journey nineteen. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
